  "title": "COMMIT received after NEWLEADER for a proposal buffered before it throws NullPointerException",
  "cause": "The update clears packetsNotCommitted at NEWLEADER while the unchanged sync-loop COMMIT handler dereferences packetsNotCommitted.peekFirst() without a null check.",
  "trigger": "A learner (re)joins an established leader while writes are in flight: outstanding PROPOSALs are forwarded before NEWLEADER and their COMMIT after it.",
  "consequence": "NullPointerException in Learner.syncWithLeader aborts synchronization; the learner returns to LOOKING and cannot join under load.",
  "sites": [
    "zookeeper-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zookeeper/server/quorum/Learner.java:643-669",
    "zookeeper-server/src/main/java/org/apache/zookeeper/server/quorum/Learner.java:757"
  ],
  "actions": [
    "LearnerSyncCommit",
    "LearnerNewLeader",
    "Propose",
    "Commit"
  ],
  "invariants": [
    "SyncCommitHasPendingProposal"
  ],
  "premises": [
    "Leader.startForwarding queues outstanding proposals before LearnerHandler queues NEWLEADER, and their COMMITs can follow NEWLEADER."
  ],
